  "bio": "Tucked away in the artistic haven of Hamburg, United States, the incomparable 400lb Guerilla is not just an artist but an enterprising spirit, proudly steering the ship at 5venoms Tattoo. Specializing in the striking contrasts of black & gray alongside the vibrant dynamism of newschool tattoos, they pair their creativity with unrivaled professionalism, ensuring each client leaves with a masterpiece etched not only on their skin but in their experience. Whether you seek a dark, delicate design or a splash of nouveau style, 400lb Guerilla’s studio is the pinnacle of tattoo artistry where every needle stroke resonates with meticulous care."
